Create a new ACF block in this theme following my block standard.

Requirements:
1. Use this folder structure:
   /blocks/block-slug/
     block.json
     render.php
     block-slug.css
2. Use block-local CSS loaded through block.json.
3. Use a unique root class with BEM-style naming.
4. Use semantic, accessible, SEO-friendly markup.
5. Escape all output properly in PHP.
6. Avoid empty wrappers.
7. Use shared design tokens from the global theme pipeline, but do not depend on theme structure or container classes.
8. Keep the block visually consistent in frontend and editor.
9. Do not manually enqueue the block CSS if it is loaded via block.json.
10. Explain every file created and why.